SUMMARY:Printmaking Festival | Stitched Editions: Responding to Tradition 
 While Yielding Something New
LOCATION:Downtown Library: 4th Floor Program Room\, 343 S Fifth Ave\, Ann 
 Arbor\, MI 48104
GEO:42.2792;-83.7462
DESCRIPTION:Melih Meric will speak on their printmaking practice in regard
 s to their unique take on print editions. Breaking from the traditional u
 nderstanding of an edition of print\, their editions create a single unif
